+ * [29] CE (apply, left set by the vendor), [28] BUSY, [27] STOP,
+ * [7:0] div; rate = src / ((div+1)*2). The vendor clk_set_rate clears
+ * (3 << stop) | div, ORs in (1 << ce) | cdr, then waits BUSY.
