+ * T40 board glue. The SPL (mach-xburst/t40) brings up console + PLL
+ * + DDR + loads U-Boot proper from SFC NOR. Full U-Boot uses driver
+ * model. T40 has a single OTG core (unlike A1's three), so the USB
+ * PHY init is simpler.
