+newly cloned source directory:
+
+.. code-block:: console
+
+    $ git clone https://source.denx.de/u-boot/u-boot.git/
+    $ cd u-boot
+
+Configure U-Boot:
+
+.. code-block:: console
+
+    $ make r8a779g3_sparrowhawk_defconfig
+
+Compile U-Boot:
+
+.. code-block:: console
