+/*
+ * The write-CRC status is a 2-bit encoded field, not flag bits:
+ * 0 = no error, 1 = card observed erroneous transmission,
+ * 2 = no CRC status was sent back (e.g. dead data lines).
+ * Any non-zero value is a failed write.
