+        linux,keymap = <
+            /*
+             * According to wiring diagram above, if L1 is configured as
+             * output and HIGH, and we detect a HIGH level on input L0,
+             * then it means S1 is pressed: MATRIX_KEY(L1, L0, KEY...)
