-MAX77620 Power management IC from Maxim Semiconductor.
-
-Required properties:
--------------------
-- compatible: Must be one of
-		"maxim,max77620"
-		"maxim,max20024"
-		"maxim,max77663"
-- reg: I2C device address.
-
-Optional properties:
--------------------
