+ * <29>    : Dual-Role Power
+ * <28>    : SNK/SRC dependent
+ * <27>    : Unconstrained Power
+ * <26>    : USB Communications Capable
+ * <25>    : Dual-Role Data
+ * <24:20> : SNK/SRC dependent
+ * <19:10> : Voltage in 50mV Units
+ * <9:0>   : Maximum Current in 10mA units
