+/*
+ * From Table 6-11 and Table 6-15 PD Rev 3.0 Ver 2.0
+ *
+ * <31:30> : Variable Supply (non-Battery)
+ * <29:20> : Maximum Voltage in 50mV units
+ * <19:10> : Minimum Voltage in 50mV units
