+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0+
+/*
+ * Copyright 2026 Free Mobile - Vincent Jardin
+ *
+ * Unit tests for the PMBus 1.x framework, the generic
+ * PMBus regulator and the pmbus CLI command.
